From: AdityaTeltia <teltia.aditya22@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 3 May 2026 12:12:22 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec: libdav2d AV2 decoder wrapper

Modeled after the libdav1d AV1 decoder implementation.
