 Go to @url{https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d} and follow the instructions for
 installing the library. Then pass @code{--enable-libdav1d} to configure to enable it.
 
+@section dav2d
+
+FFmpeg can make use of the dav2d library for AV2 video decoding.
+
+Go to @url{https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav2d} and follow the instructions for
+installing the library. Then pass @code{--enable-libdav2d} to configure to enable it.
+
 @section davs2
 
 FFmpeg can make use of the davs2 library for AVS2-P2/IEEE1857.4 video decoding.
